tkrzw provides a pkg-config module:

    pkg-config --cflags --libs tkrzw

With MSVC, pkgconf can print native compiler/linker flags:

    pkgconf --msvc-syntax --cflags --libs tkrzw

Put the installed triplet's lib/pkgconfig directory on PKG_CONFIG_PATH.
For dynamic builds, put its bin directory on PATH when running consumers.
The installed headers select the linkage; no export/import macro is required
from consumers. Compile C++ consumers with the same CRT and configuration
as the selected library.

Optional compression features are zlib, zstd, lz4 and lzma. All default off.
